@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 05. LangGraph4J Orchestration (Current Runtime)

skinparam shadowing false

start

:Request validated (outside graph);
:Scope resolved (controller-specific);
:History/checkpoint loaded (outside graph);
:Build AgentGraphState;
:Invoke CompiledGraph;

if (A2A context exists?) then (yes)
  :task already marked RUNNING at A2A controller;
else (no)
endif

:PLAN node;
if (PLAN_REQUIRED?) then (yes)
  :EXECUTE node;
  if (more executable plans?) then (yes)
    :re-plan inside execute loop;
  endif
else (no)
endif

:COMPOSE node;
:Return PlanningContext;
:ResponseComposeService stream;
:Persist history/checkpoint;

if (A2A context exists?) then (yes)
  if (success?) then (yes)
    :mark task COMPLETED;
  else (no)
    :mark task FAILED;
  endif
else (no)
endif

note right
Graph implementation
- StateGraph<AgentGraphState>
- nodes: plan, execute, compose
- edges: START->plan, plan->(execute|compose),
         execute->compose, compose->END
- checkpoint id is injected through RunnableConfig
- planning/execution must enforce AgentScope
- tool schema loading: reconnect-first, cache-second
- if A2A is used, lifecycle state is synchronized
  (COMPLETED/FAILED in orchestrator, CANCELED check each chunk)
end note

stop
@enduml
